LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
## 1. 基础设置
units               real
dimension           3
boundary            p p p
atom_style          full

## 2. 读取 PDMS Martini 数据结构
pair_style lj/cut   12.0
special_bonds       lj 0.0 0.0 0.5

bond_style          harmonic
angle_style         harmonic
dihedral_style      harmonic
read_data           pdms_viscosity.data
